<title>UK: RTZ Corp rebounds on firmer copper prices.</title>
<headline>RTZ Corp rebounds on firmer copper prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK mining group RTZ Corp rebounded on Thursday as copper prices climbed to a six-month high at the London Metals Exchange, dealers said.</p>
<p>RTZ shares were also lifted by the overnight strength in the shares of RTZ's Australian unit, CRA, overnight, they said.</p>
<p>At 1024 GMT, RTZ shares were up 11-1/2p to 978p.  </p>
<p>Some 1.2 million shares traded hands.</p>
<p>Dealings in RTZ options was fairly active, dominated by one bearish trade. Some 750 February 900 puts were bought at 6p, they said.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
